      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "A lightweight, ephemeral Invocation with an identity is enough for now",
        "statement": "For a Method that a Handler calls once per occurrence and that finishes, an Invocation needs an id, a caller, arguments, context and mode, and an Outcome keyed to it. It does not need a persisted Invocation node, a lifecycle, progress, cancellation or history yet, and adding them later will not require changing what identifies it.",
