      "data": {
        "title": "Introduce an ephemeral Invocation with an Outcome",
        "action": "Create an Invocation id for every Method call and put it in api.invocation with the caller, arguments, mode and cause (occurrence, root occurrence, delivery). Return an Outcome keyed by that id with status, result or error, duration and attempted effects. Persist nothing in the graph.",
        "expectedEvidence": "From one property change, a single diagnostic can list occurrence, delivery, Handler, Invocation and Outcome by id, including the event that the Method emitted in turn, without adding a lifecycle, progress, cancellation or history.",
